{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"4f50543f99f7225fcd6ddfe629f589e05c0655922cd97b07218d4e006aaad07c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你趁着年幼、衰败的日子尚未来到，就是你所说，我毫无喜乐的那些年日未曾临近之先，当记念造你的主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要等到日头、光明、月亮、星宿变为黑暗，雨后云彩反回，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["看守房屋的发颤，有力的屈身，推磨的稀少就止息，从窗户往外看的都昏暗；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["街门关闭，推磨的响声微小，雀鸟一叫，人就起来，唱歌的女子也都衰微。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["人怕高处，路上有惊慌，杏树开花，蚱蜢成为重担，人所愿的也都废掉；因为人归他永远的家，吊丧的在街上往来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["银链折断，金罐破裂，瓶子在泉旁损坏，水轮在井口破烂，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["尘土仍归于地，灵仍归于赐灵的 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["传道者说：「虚空的虚空，凡事都是虚空。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["结论"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["再者，传道者因有智慧，仍将知识教训众人；又默想，又考查，又陈说许多箴言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["传道者专心寻求可喜悦的言语，是凭正直写的诚实话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["智慧人的言语好像刺棍；会中之师的言语又像钉稳的钉子，都是一个牧者所赐的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我儿，还有一层，你当受劝戒：著书多，没有穷尽；读书多，身体疲倦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["这些事都已听见了，总意就是：敬畏 神，谨守他的诫命，这是人所当尽的本分",{"noteId":8},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因为人所做的事，连一切隐藏的事，无论是善是恶， 神都必审问。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"或译：这是众人的本分","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/SNG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ECC/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}